{"cut_proposal":{"candidate_errors":[],"prefix":"To solve for the value of \\(d\\) in the given operation \\(x \\star y = ax + by + cxy\\), we start by using the given conditions to form equations involving \\(a\\), \\(b\\), and \\(c\\).\n\nFirst, we use the condition \\(1 \\star 2 = 3\\):\n\\[\na(1) + b(2) + c(1)(2) = 3 \\implies a + 2b + 2c = 3.\n\\]\nNext, we use the condition \\(2 \\star 3 = 4\\):\n\\[\na(2) + b(3) + c(2)(3) = 4 \\implies 2a + 3b + 6c = 4.\n\\]\n\nWe also know that there is a non-zero real number \\(d\\) such that \\(x \\star d = x\\) for any real number \\(x\\). This means:\n\\[\nax + bd + cxd = x \\implies (a + bd + cd)x = x.\n\\]\nSince this must hold for any \\(x\\), the coefficient of \\(x\\) must be 1:\n\\[\na + bd + cd = 1.\n\\]\n\nNow we have a system of three equations:\n1. \\(a + 2b + 2c = 3\\),\n2. \\(2a + 3b + 6c = 4\\),\n3. \\(a + bd + cd = 1\\).\n\n","prefix_end":777,"status":"review_required"},"eligible":true,"generation":{"generation":{"max_new_tokens":2048,"temperature":0.7,"top_k":0,"top_p":1.0},"ids":[1249,11625,369,279,897,315,17767,67,57758,304,279,2661,5666,17767,87,1124,11870,379,284,3859,488,553,488,272,4130,59,701,582,1191,553,1667,279,2661,4682,311,1352,37906,15860,17767,64,59,701,17767,65,59,701,323,17767,66,59,3593,5338,11,582,990,279,2971,17767,16,1124,11870,220,17,284,220,18,59,982,59,9640,64,7,16,8,488,293,7,17,8,488,272,7,16,2376,17,8,284,220,18,1124,6383,550,264,488,220,17,65,488,220,17,66,284,220,18,624,59,921,5847,11,582,990,279,2971,17767,17,1124,11870,220,18,284,220,19,59,982,59,9640,64,7,17,8,488,293,7,18,8,488,272,7,17,2376,18,8,284,220,19,1124,6383,550,220,17,64,488,220,18,65,488,220,21,66,284,220,19,624,59,2533,1654,1083,1414,429,1052,374,264,2477,36929,1931,1372,17767,67,57758,1741,429,17767,87,1124,11870,294,284,856,57758,369,894,1931,1372,17767,87,59,568,1096,3363,510,59,9640,706,488,21486,488,272,9703,284,856,1124,6383,550,320,64,488,21486,488,15307,50724,284,856,624,59,921,12549,419,1969,3331,369,894